{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and read it anywhere inside with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":", and queues"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catch up; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the records."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the waits of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process exits. A tracker given a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"title":"Tracker","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51"},"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeadin